<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hartley Poynton half yr net up 89 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hartley Poynton half yr net up 89 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockbroker Hartley Poynton Ltd said on Thursday it made a net profit after tax of A$3.01 million for the half year to December 31, up 89 percent on the previous corresponding period.</p>
</text>
